"screentime.scope" = "Apple's automatic adult-content web filter is an additional layer, not a guarantee for all apps or images. Personal authorization can be revoked in system settings and does not prevent deletion. Hisn reads configuration, not real-world blocking success. The filter remains configured after the plan ends until you choose to turn it off.";
