"screentime.consentBody" = "Authorize your own account with Apple, without a partner. Hisn will configure Apple's automatic adult-content web filter. Existing authorized access is reused, not replaced with weaker self-authorization. No uninstall lock is promised. During your commitment Hisn will not offer to disable this filter.";
