"removal.title" = "Optional family removal protection";
"network.title" = "An independent home-network layer";
"network.steps" = "If you own or administer your router, use its official guide to set adult-content filtering DNS for the home network: 1.1.1.3 and 1.0.0.3, including the provider's IPv6 settings where supported. Keep a record of the previous settings. Then check from each device. No router password is collected by Hisn.";
"network.scope" = "This manual router layer survives closing Hisn, but only protects traffic that uses that network and DNS. Mobile data, alternate DNS and VPNs may bypass it. Hisn does not upload lists or change the router automatically here, and cannot confirm this layer from the phone. Keep recovery available; do not erase router credentials.";
