"removal.unavailable" = "Unavailable here; a real child device is required";
"removal.body" = "On a child's device, Apple's guardian-approved Family Controls authorization prevents removal of this parental-control app while authorization remains active. Self-authorization does not prevent deletion. This does not lock DNS or Safari settings.";
"removal.request" = "Request guardian authorization";
"removal.consent.title" = "Authorize protection on a child's device?";
"removal.consent.body" = "A parent or guardian in the same Apple Family Sharing group must approve Apple's prompt on the child's device. Active child authorization prevents removal of Hisn and iCloud sign-out. Only continue with the guardian present and consenting. No weaker self-authorization will be requested if this fails.";
"removal.manual" = "For self-use, ask a trusted person to configure Screen Time's app-deletion restriction and keep its separate passcode. On iOS 16–26, look under Content & Privacy Restrictions → iTunes & App Store Purchases (or App Installations & Purchases) → Deleting Apps → Don't Allow. Newer layouts vary; use Apple's guide. Hisn cannot verify this manual restriction.";
"removal.recovery" = "The guardian retains control and can revoke Screen Time access through Apple's settings. After restarting Hisn, an approved status alone cannot prove child authorization; verify with the guardian. Removing the Home Screen icon is not the same as uninstalling. Device reset and guardian revocation are not prevented.";
"removal.guide" = "Apple's family setup guide";
"removal.simulator" = "Guardian authorization cannot be tested in Simulator. Use a signed build on a real child's device with a guardian in the same family.";
"removal.failed" = "Child authorization was not confirmed. Check the child account, Family Sharing, guardian approval and the app's Family Controls entitlement. No fallback authorization was requested.";
"family.steps" = "Add Screen Time's adult-website restriction in Content & Privacy Restrictions. For family protection, let a trusted guardian keep its passcode.";
"family.scope" = "Hisn can configure its own app shields and adult-web filter after Apple authorization. The family Screen Time settings described here are manual and unverified; managed-device enforcement is not included.";
"language.title" = "Language";
