"privacy.title" = "Privacy";
"privacy.body" = "Hisn does not record visited sites or blocked browsing attempts. Safari applies declarative rules without sending browsing history to Hisn. Family DNS is handled by Cloudflare under its own privacy policy. To check commitment, daily budget and passcode dates, Hisn reads the time from apple.com over HTTPS; nothing about you is sent.";
"coverage.title" = "What this version protects";
"coverage.body" = "A self-control commitment, Safari domain blockers, separately enabled Hisn Text webpage checking, selected-app shields, optional family DNS and Apple's adult-content web filter. These do not guarantee all content, all apps, VPN resistance or protection that cannot be disabled. Hisn works independently of your Mac; settings do not sync yet.";
"apple.title" = "iPhone and iPad";
"apple.body" = "One universal app for iOS and iPadOS 16 or later. Real-device DNS and Screen Time need signing and matching DNS Settings and Family Controls capabilities. Family Controls distribution also requires Apple's entitlement approval. An unsigned build is not an installable phone release.";
