"vault.title" = "Passcode vault";
"vault.body" = "Hisn makes a Screen Time passcode and keeps it from you until the date you choose. If you set it as your Screen Time passcode and set Deleting Apps to Don't Allow (steps 1 and 2), apps, Hisn included, cannot be deleted and Screen Time cannot be changed before then. Hisn cannot check that you did. No second person is needed.";
