"vault.steps" = "1. Settings › Screen Time › Lock Screen Time Settings: enter this passcode twice.\n2. Screen Time › Content & Privacy Restrictions: turn on, then App Store purchases › Deleting Apps › Don't Allow.\n3. Optional: Content & Privacy Restrictions › Web content › Limit Adult Websites.\n4. Come back and tap Seal.";
