"vault.limits" = "Apple lets the adult who set a Screen Time passcode reset it with their Apple Account password, and erasing the iPhone removes everything. If someone else organizes your Family Sharing, the reset needs their account instead. Showing the passcode needs the date to have passed on this iPhone and on Apple's server time, so moving the clock does not open it. The passcode is kept only on this device, outside backups.";
