"commitment.trustedTime" = "Moving this iPhone's clock does not end the commitment or start a new budget day early: the date must have passed on this iPhone and on Apple's server time. While a commitment or daily budget is on, Hisn reads the time from apple.com over HTTPS; nothing about you is sent. Without internet, the commitment stays on.";
"commitment.restoreConsent" = "Hisn's Screen Time filter is on, and this commitment records that. If iOS drops the filter while Screen Time access is still allowed, Hisn turns it back on the next time it opens. Hisn never asks for access by itself.";
"alerts.enable" = "Alert me if a layer stops";
